ked floor"},{"uid":"GGwk-lihL-hnSp-wEiP","range":0,"content":"White quartz altar"}]},{"uid":"ZBNE-Hsc5-MSnX-vv2J","title":"Adventure site - Puzzles","diceFormula":"1d6","rows":[{"uid":"mwFY-Itxs-cBMj-n6rI","range":0,"content":"Room with a floor made of an electrified copper plate. A piece of valuable treasure sits in the centre."},{"uid":"aylF-9U6D-qgws-os77","range":0,"content":"Three feeding bottles with different-colored liquid inside. Each is inert individually but powerful/dangerous when mixed."},{"uid":"iHJJ-G0gi-fbVW-qeF7","range":0,"content":"A crystal, a magic sword embedded inside. The crystal is very hard, but will dissolve in stomach acid."},{"uid":"KxQo-2DCR-gaGv-aqAx","range":0,"content":"Treasure is at the bottom of deep well."},{"uid":"ezne-nwBj-6jK2-S8Ee","range":0,"content":"Large smooth steel bowl, upside down. Treasure taped to the inside ceiling of the bowl."},{"uid":"XAi7-9qIU-A7zr-E4LC","range":0,"content":"Baited mousetrap. The lever is wired to a stone in the wall and will collapse the corridor if triggered"}]},{"uid":"ceKB-D8WC-3Wj0-pcri","title":"Settlement - Governance (d6 + Settlement size (1 for Farm, 6 for City))","diceFormula":"1d6","rows":[{"uid":"w2X3-y4Z5-a6B7-c8D9","range":0,"content":"1 Guided by village elders"},{"uid":"e0F1-g2H3-i4J5-k6L7","range":0,"content":"2 Guided by village elders"},{"uid":"m8N9-o0P1-q2R3-s4T5","range":0,"content":"3 Guided by village elders"},{"uid":"u6V7-w8X9-y0Z1-a2B3","range":0,"content":"4 Administered by a knight or lower-caste lord"},{"uid":"c4D5-e6F7-g8H9-i0J1","range":0,"content":"5 Administered by a knight or lower-caste lord"},{"uid":"k2L3-m4N5-o6P7-q8R9","range":0,"content":"6 Organised by a guild committee"},{"uid":"gqjw-f7wK-wuNT-DinI","range":0,"content":"7 Organised by a guild committee"},{"uid":"lp6k-sRCX-s16s-rjfH","range":0,"content":"8 Free settlement, governed by council of burghermice"},{"uid":"r8fU-Dp5x-QVji-hhCV","range":0,"content":"9 Free settlement, governed by council of burghermice"},{"uid":"9RNf-oYUi-3d2f-y9kC","range":0,"content":"10 House of an upper caste noblemouse"},{"uid":"UVsN-ARL5-NIMu-bAFp","range":0,"content":"11 House of an upper caste noblemouse"},{"uid":"S4nx-XHN1-e2QD-Jkto","range":0,"content":"12 Seat of baronial power"}]},{"uid":"e1XH-sSiw-AE2F-qpBO","title":"Adventure site - Large treasure","diceFormula":"1d6","rows":[{"uid":"4cym-5cKr-NBhP-QBcA","range":0,"content":"Oversized silver spoon (2 slots, 300p)"},{"uid":"QY5N-Dken-EmBE-S4Rk","range":0,"content":"Ivory comb (4 slots, 400p)"},{"uid":"tq4m-XAhE-oDTO-bTN5","range":0,"content":"Huge bottle of fine brandy (4 slots, 500p)"},{"uid":"8xWv-jNEI-0bVX-BkuP","range":0,"content":"Ancient mouse statue (4 slots, 500p)"},{"uid":"2RS2-veVD-J4DS-grXi","range":0,"content":"Ancient mouse throne (6 slots, 1000p)"},{"uid":"ALcW-bIcs-ArFB-0oGs","range":0,"content":"Giant golden wristwatch (4 slots, 1000p)"}]},{"uid":"ej0K-seP8-hPSP-mCei","title":"Settlement - Industry","diceFormula":"1d20","rows":[{"uid":"y4Z5-a6B7-c8D9-e0F1","range":0,"content":"Farmers, tending to towering crops"},{"uid":"g2H3-i4J5-k6L7-m8N9","range":0,"content":"Woodcutters, with saws and harnesses"},{"uid":"o0P1-q2R3-s4T5-u6V7","range":0,"content":"Rough and scarred fishermice, with nets and rafts"},{"uid":"w8X9-y0Z1-a2B3-c4D5","range":0,"content":"Dark and musty mushroom farm"},{"uid":"e6F7-g8H9-i0J1-k2L3","range":0,"content":"Grains drying on every flat surface"},{"uid":"m4N5-o6P7-q8R9-s0T1","range":0,"content":"Pungent cheese, cured for years"},{"uid":"u2V3-w4X5-y6Z7-a8B9","range":0,"content":"Gardens of rare herbs. Drying racks are guarded"},{"uid":"c0D1-e2F3-g4H5-i6J7","range":0,"content":"Hive of bees and their veiled keepers"},{"uid":"k8L9-m0N1-o2P3-q4R5","range":0,"content":"Merchants and traders, often in need of guards"},{"uid":"s6T7-u8V9-w0X1-y2Z3","range":0,"content":"Stonemasons, working a nearby quarry"},{"uid":"a4B5-c6D7-e8F9-g0H1","range":0,"content":"Flour mill, driven by a large water-wheel"},{